Third-party material
--------------------
* configs/apns-conf.xml is the stock carrier APN database.  It retains its
  original Apache-2.0 notice; the carrier data remains subject to its source.
* recovery/root/system/bin/mtk_plpath_utils is a prebuilt MediaTek binary.
* recovery/root/init.recovery.mt6768.rc,
  recovery/root/system/etc/init/mtk-plpath-utils.rc and
  rootdir/etc/fstab.mt6768 are derived from the stock X663 firmware.  They
  are marked `SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 AND
  LicenseRef-Stock-Firmware`; the stock portions remain subject to
  Infinix/Transsion terms.

`LicenseRef-Stock-Firmware` refers to proprietary firmware material supplied
with the X663.  It is included only to reproduce the stock device behaviour
and is not licensed under Apache-2.0.

No vendor image is included in or required by this tree.
